        {
          "id": 2862090041,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Yeah, I should have highlighted the following section of code as well when commenting.  I'm not a fan of how GitLab chooses the context to show for comments...\n\nThe code _immediately following_ the section shown above will always assign a new value to `appname_with_version`, leading to the leak of the value assigned in the section shown above.",
